{"id": "DfKsX5wxIL8", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "What should you pour on Shiva, and what does each one give you? The Shiva Purana answers, liquid by liquid. 🔱\n\nNot a splash: the Shiva Purana calls it Dhara, one stream that never breaks (Rudra Samhita, Srishti Khanda 14.67). Then it lists what each stream brings:\n💧 Water: eases fever (14.68–70)\n🧈 Ghee: your family flourishes (14.72)\n🥛 Milk with sugar: a mind as sharp as Brihaspati, guru of the gods (14.74–75)\n🍯 Honey: wealth, like Kubera (14.80)\n🌿 Sugarcane juice: every joy (14.80)\n🌊 Ganga jal: the joys of this life AND moksha (14.81–82)\nAnd with every stream, the Mahamrityunjaya mantra, ten thousand times (14.82).\n\nScreenshot this before Monday, Shiva's day. Which one will YOU pour? Comment below 👇 Share it with someone who does Rudrabhishek.\n\n📚 Our Navadurga picture books for kids are out now: the stories of the Devi, beautifully illustrated. Link in bio · rishikatha.com\n\nFollow @therishikatha: next, do your Diwali aarti WITH our reel.\n\n#shiva #mahadev #rudrabhishek #abhishekam #shivling #harharmahadev #shivapurana #sanatandharma #hindutemple #mahamrityunjaya #bholenath #somvar #hinduism #omnamahshivaya #rishikatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1793467761, "like_count": 125918, "comment_count": 375, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2383780489028358a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 52.294, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMpQ3jUrq-JCArACqxNzigbyy3_NEy0Lv0q_trEQk2ZmFjhbzIWERW1Z7S6MBbbsyXklMmmcRQ5y7QIc9hJ5_uD546aWjQKBS_0usk.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=DDGcxumoot0Q7kNvwH7IXbr&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=jaNBeJejQewe11WrQ0-9Lw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQMY9TXa20NoLHpWu-keQco0YGU