", "timestamp": 1794149999, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "therealsamxx7", "author_id": "22257139310", "id": "17993905260116733", "text": "I thought the red liquid was blood", "timestamp": 1794129013, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "s_h_r_e_y_a_n_n", "author_id": "46135345339", "id": "17894863719621454", "text": "What if I don't eat and give my food to a poor needy person and die", "timestamp": 1794120443, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "bhaduriabhishek", "author_id": "1418342925", "id": "18026689847870064", "text": "Har har mahadev", "timestamp": 1794058798, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "toxic.t15", "author_id": "35333302250", "id": "17916275475549371", "text": "Back when this was actually done, under the shivling, everything was collected and fed to people around as panch-amrut, but lately its less devotion and more show of items. And mainly now it’s not served is because the offerings people bring, some are good quality while some are the cheapest option in the shelves, making it contaminated and inedible.", "timestamp": 1794055148, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "mayuri_gadkar", "author_id": "3265550802", "id": "18099333635398709", "text": "The only essence is good karma nothing else matters to him. He will show you way automatically.", "timestamp": 1794047825, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "maneetzzz", "author_id": "60401085746", "id": "18106901309371331", "text": "Har Har mahadev", "timestamp": 1793881962, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfKsX5wxIL8/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfKsX5wxIL8", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/875662014_18130951792755882_3310449228876417176_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=NDAyMDIyMDc3Mzk5NzUxMTQyMA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=6cXNO7iQG-gQ7kNvw